Pray takes the words:
Your hand holds the broken-heart.
Write the words with your hand.
Oh!

Forever is the key.
Forever is with forever, forever.

The echoes hold a fabricated make-believe.
Turn the echoes up!
Rock them like a fabricated truth.
Rock them like traveling lost-men.
Rock them like a, b, c!

Rock the echoes forever with forever over 9.
Rock them with forever without 2.
Rock them forever, forever.

Forever:
Rock them like a fabricated truth.
Rock them like again easiness.

Pray taking the echoes!

The flame is a powerhouse.

Listen to the wind blow,
Burn the wind with the flame!

The heartbeat is now the wind,
The silence is nothing like we've seen before!

The firstborn is contentment,
The shadow is inevitable.

While the silence is less than the heartbeat,
Let the fallen be the firstborn.
Let the firstborn be with the shadow.
The shadow is now the fallen.
Build the silence up, yeah!

Shout the shadow with the silence without the heartbeat!